  "details": "VRChat Version:1062\n\nDescription of the bug: When a second account is logged in on the same PC as a first account, the friends list will show up for the first account and friends on that list will see the first account as online and may attempt to join it.\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): Logging into a VRChat account, logging out and logging into a second/Steam account.\n\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): N/A",
